              "value": "Curse of the Crooked Cane"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(curse, primal)\n\nWhen a creature slays a cairn linnorm, it must succeed at a 44 Will save or become permanently enfeebled 2.\n\nIn addition, the victim ages at an accelerated rate, aging 1 year every day, eventually causing it to die of old age if the curse is left untended."
